             424     2               !    eta     - actual latent heat flux (w m-2: positive, if upward from sfc)
             425     2               !    sheat   - sensible heat flux (w m-2: positive, if upward from sfc)
             426     2               !    beta    - ratio of actual/potential evap (dimensionless)
             427     2               !    etp     - potential evaporation (w m-2)
             428     2               !    ssoil   - soil heat flux (w m-2: negative if downward from surface)
