             483     2               !    flx2    - freezing rain latent heat flux (w m-2)
             484     2               !    flx3    - phase-change heat flux from snowmelt (w m-2)
             485     2               !    snomlt  - snow melt (m) (water equivalent)
             486     2               !    sncovr  - fractional snow cover (unitless fraction, 0-1)
             487     2               !    runoff3 - numerical trunctation in excess of porosity (smcmax)
             488     2               !              for a given soil layer at the end of a time step
             489     2               !    rc      - canopy resistance (s m-1)
             490     2               !    pc      - plant coefficient (unitless fraction, 0-1) where pc*etp
             491     2               !              = actual transp
             492     2               !    xlai    - leaf area index (dimensionless)
             493     2               !    rsmin   - minimum canopy resistance (s m-1)
             494     2               !    rcs     - incoming solar rc factor (dimensionless)
             495     2               !    rct     - air temperature rc factor (dimensionless)
             496     2               !    rcq     - atmos vapor pressure deficit rc factor (dimensionless)
             497     2               !    rcsoil  - soil moisture rc factor (dimensionless)
             498     2               !    soilw   - available soil moisture in root zone (unitless fraction
             499     2               !              between smcwlt and smcmax)
             500     2               !    soilm   - total soil column moisture content (frozen+unfrozen) (m)
             501     2               !    smcwlt  - wilting point (volumetric)
             502     2               !    smcdry  - dry soil moisture threshold where direct evap frm top
             503     2               !              layer ends (volumetric)
             504     2               !    smcref  - soil moisture threshold where transpiration begins to
             505     2               !              stress (volumetric)
             506     2               !    smcmax  - porosity, i.e. saturated value of soil moisture
             507     2               !              (volumetric)
